This licence covers RasaEdit and its format library (external/trformats). It does
not cover:

- The Blender add-on in tools/blender/rasaedit_addon, which is licensed under the
  GNU General Public License, version 3 or later (as declared in its
  blender_manifest.toml), because Blender add-ons are built on Blender's GPL API.
- The third-party libraries RasaEdit is built with (SDL3, SDL3_mixer, Dear ImGui,
  FreeType, SQLite, MariaDB Connector/C, mpg123, libvorbis, libogg, zlib and their
  dependencies), which keep their own licences; distributed packages carry them in
  the licenses folder.
- Tabula Rasa's game files, which RasaEdit reads and edits but does not include.
